&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fans of the Fuuka x Yotsuba&amp;rsquo;s father pairing from Yotsubato! (Yotsuba&amp;amp;!) will love this gorgeously full animated doujin software production from circle Kinako no Yama. The title &amp;ldquo;Kazeaji&amp;rdquo;, or &amp;ldquo;a taste of wind&amp;rdquo;, is a parody on Fuuka&amp;rsquo;s name, the kanji of which mean &amp;ldquo;wind&amp;rdquo; and &amp;ldquo;scent&amp;rdquo;; and when you see the glorious animation here you&amp;rsquo;ll see that it&amp;rsquo;s more than a taste of everything Fuuka has to offer. Positions from missionary to cowgirl, oral sex in multiple varieties (both giving and receiving) make this a lusciously full-voiced anime project you won&amp;rsquo;t want to miss.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>